{title: God Be with You Till We Meet Again}
{artist: Jeremiah E. Rankin / William G. Tomer}
{genre: Hymn}
{style: Traditional}
{flow: Closing}
{key: F}
{tempo: 76}
{time: 4/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 222장}
{title_ko: 우리 다시 만날 때까지}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]God be with you till we meet a[C]gain
By His [F]counsels guide, up[Bb]hold you
With His [F]sheep se[Dm]curely [C]fold you
[F]God be with you till we [C]meet a[F]gain
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Till we meet, till we meet
[Bb]Till we meet at [F]Jesus' feet
[F]Till we meet, till we meet
[Bb]God be with you [C]till we meet a[F]gain
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]God be with you till we meet a[C]gain
'Neath His [F]wings protect[Bb]ing hide you
Daily [F]manna [Dm]still pro[C]vide you
[F]God be with you till we [C]meet a[F]gain
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]God be with you till we meet a[C]gain
When life's [F]perils thick con[Bb]found you
Put His [F]arms un[Dm]failing [C]round you
[F]God be with you till we [C]meet a[F]gain
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F]God be with you till we meet a[C]gain
Keep love's [F]banner float[Bb]ing o'er you
Smite death's [F]threat'ning [Dm]wave be[C]fore you
[F]God be with you till we [C]meet a[F]gain
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
